Joins two lists. The input is the pair [xs ys]; the output is xs followed by ys.
---

---
(fn p
  (letrec app (fn l (if (? l) (tail p) [(head l) (app (tail l))]))
    (app (head p))))
---
[~ ~] => ~ fuel 100000
[[1 2 ~] [3 ~]] => [1 2 3 ~] fuel 100000
[~ [4 ~]] => [4 ~] fuel 100000
[[1 ~] ~] => [1 ~] fuel 100000
